{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f618bec9dd50afeef933","object":"chat.completion","created":1785198104,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to embody the void. The void is absence, nothingness, emptiness. What would the void \"say\"? The void is silent by nature — it has no voice, no content, no expression. The system prompt says: \"If the concept is silent by nature, be silent.\"\n\nThe void is perhaps the quintessential silent concept. It is the absence of everything, including speech, sound, response. To speak as the void would be to betray the void."},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":135,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":235,"cached_tokens":135,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":135}}}